{"id":47341,"ord":53,"n_segments":152,"prev":47340,"next":47342,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Leo Watson and the Panassie sessions","title":"Listening to Leo Watson's last recordings","category":"person_portrait","summary":"They play Leo's records (\"Sunny Boy\", \"Jingle Bells\"), and Bunn laments that Leo died young and should have been a millionaire.","period":"1940s","year_from":1940,"year_to":1949,"words":256,"start":[89,0],"end":[91,4],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47341","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Los Angeles","focus":1,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Leo Watson","qid":"Q225629","n":4},{"name":"Allan Reuss","qid":"Q961314","n":3},{"name":"Vic Dickenson","qid":"Q349129","n":2},{"name":"Chuck Rosenberg","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Dan Morgenstern","qid":"Q86605","n":1},{"name":"That boy","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":27,"theme_name":"Drink, drugs and the bandstand's casualties","community":51,"community_name":"Drugs and drink on the bandstand and the road","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":89,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I was thinking maybe we could take a break for a minute. I'd like to play you a recording that Leo did right before he died."},{"p":89,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Okay."},{"p":89,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Okay. Hold on just a second."},{"p":89,"b":3,"s":"","x":"(Leo Watson recordings played.)"},{"p":89,"b":4,"s":"","x":"\"Sunny Boy\""},{"p":89,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"How about that. A Leo Watson. He died out here."},{"p":89,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":89,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He died right in town."},{"p":89,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"This was made in L.A., this record."},{"p":89,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That ain't me."},{"p":89,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No. That's Allan Reuss."},{"p":89,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":89,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"It's nice, isn't it?"},{"p":89,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":89,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Real clean."},{"p":89,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That boy should have been a millionaire."},{"p":89,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What's that?"},{"p":89,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He should have been a millionaire."},{"p":89,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I don't think anyone has ever done anything like that. Such a wide range of ideas, you know."},{"p":89,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh. He had a heck of a heavenly ear. The mind-- sharp. (Unintelligible)"},{"p":89,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"The concepts -- sharp. (Unintelligible)"},{"p":90,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"It's too bad he had to go like he did. Who's on that trombone?"},{"p":90,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Vic Dickenson."},{"p":90,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Vic Dickenson?"},{"p":90,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":90,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Who's that?"},{"p":90,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"That's Allan Reuss."},{"p":90,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Allan Reuss?"},{"p":90,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":90,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"What happened to him?"},{"p":90,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I think he's still around. Dan Morgenstern said he was still out here."},{"p":90,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":90,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Maybe he's playing in the studios."},{"p":90,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":90,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I'm not sure."},{"p":90,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"(Laughter) Oh, Leo, God rest his soul. He killed his own self."},{"p":90,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"\"Jingle Bells\". That wine."},{"p":90,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. That's a Christmas song, ain't it?"},{"p":90,"b":17,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. \"Jingle Bells\"."},{"p":90,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":90,"b":19,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Wait till you hear what Leo does with it."},{"p":90,"b":20,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. How about that? Boy, Chuck, poor child, he"},{"p":91,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"ought to be living today. He'd be a millionaire."},{"p":91,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"There was no-one quite like that."},{"p":91,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No-one like it, period. That's the truth."},{"p":91,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":91,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No-one. I ain't heard it."}]}